0 out of 10 changed files in this pull request and generated 5 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tool/internal/filter/combinator.go | Adds `OneOf` combinator type and `Match` implementation. |\r\n| tool/internal/filter/build.go | Updates filter definition builder to support `one-of` and extracts `buildLeaf`. |\r\n| tool/internal/filter/combinator_test.go | Adds OneOf behavior tests (empty, short-circuit, nesting). |\r\n| tool/internal/filter/build_test.go | Adds builder tests covering `OneOf` construction and error cases. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/instrument_test.go | Refactors where-filter evaluation into `whereFilterMatches` helper for golden integration tests. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/one-of-filter-match/rules.yml | Adds integration test rule using `where: one-of` that should match. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/one-of-filter-match/one_of_filter_match.otelc.globals.go.golden | Golden output for the matching case (generated globals). |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/one-of-filter-match/one_of_filter_match.main.go.golden | Golden output showing instrumentation applied when one-of matches. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/one-of-filter-no-match/rules.yml | Adds integration test rule using `where: one-of` that should not match. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/testdata/golden/one-of-filter-no-match/one_of_filter_no_match.main.go.golden | Golden output showing no instrumentation when one-of does not match. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructio